        <p><strong>Morning:</strong> Breakfast at a traditional sidewalk table on Boulevard Saint-Germain, followed by a stroll through the Luxembourg Gardens. Watch local chess masters compete under the chestnut trees.</p>
        <p><strong>Afternoon:</strong> Visit the magnificent <strong>Musée d'Orsay</strong> in the 7th Arrondissement, housed inside an opulent 1900 Beaux-Arts railway station, to admire Monet, Van Gogh, Degas, and Cézanne.</p>
        <p><strong>Evening:</strong> Walk through Champ-de-Mars to picnic or view the Eiffel Tower at sunset. Stay to watch the five-minute sparkling light illumination that occurs on the hour every evening after dusk.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Day 3 -->
      <div class="roam-day-card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;">
